---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Whano">
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-6">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Last updated: August 24, 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">1. What We Collect</h2>
          <p>Whano collects the following information to provide the Service:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Shopify store data:</strong> Store name, domain, and order information (customer names, phone numbers, order details, shipping status).</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp data:</strong> Message content exchanged between Whano and your customers through the Service.</li>
            <li><strong>Account data:</strong> Email address, billing information, and usage statistics.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
          <p>We use collected data solely to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Send automated WhatsApp messages to your customers on your behalf.</li>
            <li>Process and display order and conversation data in your dashboard.</li>
            <li>Generate AI-powered product recommendations based on purchase history.</li>
            <li>Send you billing invoices and account notifications.</li>
            <li>Improve the Service through aggregated, anonymized usage data.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">3. Data Sharing</h2>
          <p>We do not sell your data. We share data only with:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>WhatsApp (Meta):</strong> To deliver messages to your customers.</li>
            <li><strong>Shopify:</strong> To read order data and manage the integration.</li>
            <li><strong>AI providers:</strong> To generate conversational replies (data is processed and not retained by the AI provider).</li>
            <li><strong>Payment processor:</strong> To handle billing (Stripe).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">4. Data Storage</h2>
          <p>Your data is stored on secure servers in the EU. We retain your data for as long as your account is active. Upon account deletion, all personal data is deleted within 30 days. Message history is retained for 90 days for service quality purposes, then permanently deleted.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">5. Customer Data</h2>
          <p>Your customers' data (phone numbers, names, order details) is processed by Whano solely to deliver the Service to them. We do not use your customers' data for marketing, profiling, or any purpose beyond what is necessary to send the messages you have configured.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">6. Security</h2>
          <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption in transit (TLS 1.3), encryption at rest, access controls, and regular security audits. No system is 100% secure, but we take every reasonable precaution to protect your data.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">7. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Access all data we hold about you and your store.</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data.</li>
            <li>Export your data in a machine-readable format.</li>
            <li>Object to processing of your data.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:privacy@whano.app" class="text-accent hover:underline">privacy@whano.app</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">8. Cookies</h2>
          <p>Whano uses essential cookies only for authentication and session management. We do not use tracking cookies or third-party analytics that profile your visitors.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be communicated via email or through the Service. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent revision.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">10. Contact</h2>
          <p>For privacy-related questions, email <a href="mailto:privacy@whano.app" class="text-accent hover:underline">privacy@whano.app</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
